cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the accompanying paper."
type: software
title: "cattleHolPanSV: Holstein pangenome construction and structural variant calling"
abstract: >-
  Workflows for HiFi assembly, Minigraph-Cactus pangenome construction, structural
  variant and SNV calling across long- and short-read platforms, cross-caller and
  cross-pangenome benchmarking, and SV-based GWAS in cattle.
